<%
    const footerUser = locals.user || null;
    const footerRole = footerUser ? footerUser.role : null;
%>
<footer class="site-footer" aria-label="Site footer">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="site-footer-intro">
            <a class="site-footer-brand" href="/" aria-label="Jacob Estate home">
                <img class="brand-logo" src="/jacobrent-mark.svg" alt=""><span>Jacob Estate</span>
            </a>
            <p><strong>Jacob Estate</strong> is an online marketplace where people in Nigeria find <a href="/properties?type=rent">homes to rent</a> and <a href="/properties?type=sale">properties for sale</a>. Every listing comes with a video tour, so you can see a place properly before you visit. You can read more <a href="/about">about us</a>, browse the <a href="/faq">frequently asked questions</a>, or <a href="/contact">contact us</a> directly at <a href="mailto:Jacobintegratedservices@gmail.com">Jacobintegratedservices@gmail.com</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="site-footer-sections">
            <section class="site-footer-section">
                <h2>Finding a home</h2>
                <p>Start with <a href="/properties">all homes</a>, or go straight to <a href="/properties?type=rent">homes for rent</a> or <a href="/properties?type=sale">properties for sale</a>. Watch the video tour on each listing, then keep the ones you like in your <a href="/saved-properties">saved homes</a> so you can compare them later. If you are not sure how booking, inquiries or payment work, the <a href="/faq">FAQ</a> explains each step, and the <a href="/safety">safety page</a> lists what to check before you pay.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="site-footer-section">
                <h2>For property owners</h2>
                <p>
                    <% if (footerRole === 'landlord') { %>
                        Manage your homes from your <a href="/dashboard">owner dashboard</a>, see everything you have posted under <a href="/my-properties">my listings</a>, or <a href="/add-property">add a new property</a> with its video tour.
                    <% } else if (!footerUser) { %>
                        If you own a home you want to rent out or sell, <a href="/register/landlord">sign up as a property owner</a> and post it with a video tour.
                    <% } else { %>
                        Property owners post their homes with a video tour and are paid through the platform.
                    <% } %>
                    Our <a href="/listing-guidelines">listing guidelines</a> explain what a good listing needs and how listings are reviewed, the <a href="/payment-policy">payment policy</a> explains payments and payouts, and the <a href="/advertising-disclosure">advertising disclosure</a> explains how promoted content is labelled.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="site-footer-section">
                <h2>Your account</h2>
                <p>
                    <% if (!footerUser) { %>
                        <a href="/login">Sign in</a> to see your bookings and saved homes, or <a href="/register">create an account</a> if you are new. If you cannot remember your password you can <a href="/forgot-password">reset it by email</a>, and property owners can use the <a href="/register/landlord">owner sign-up</a> instead.
                    <% } else { %>
                        Update your details and password in your <a href="/profile">profile and settings</a>.
                        <% if (footerRole === 'student') { %>
                            You can follow your payments under <a href="/my-bookings">my bookings</a> and your questions to owners under <a href="/my-inquiries">my inquiries</a>.
                        <% } %>
                        <% if (footerRole === 'admin') { %>
                            Review listings and users in the <a href="/admin">admin panel</a>.
                        <% } %>
                        When you are finished, <a href="/logout">log out</a>.
                    <% } %>
                    How we look after your information is explained in the <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a> and the <a href="/data-protection">data protection page</a>.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="site-footer-section">
                <h2>Company</h2>
                <p>Learn who we are and what we do on the <a href="/about">about page</a>. If you have a question, a complaint or feedback, the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> shows how to reach us, and most common questions are already answered in the <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>. Our promotional content is labelled in the <a href="/advertising-disclosure">advertising disclosure</a>.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="site-footer-section">
                <h2>Trust and safety</h2>
                <p>Read the <a href="/safety">safety and fraud prevention advice</a> before you send any money, and always inspect a property yourself. Listings are reviewed under our <a href="/listing-guidelines">listing guidelines</a>, and a &ldquo;verified&rdquo; label reflects that review only, not a guarantee of ownership, condition or availability. Payments are explained in the <a href="/payment-policy">payment policy</a>, and the <a href="/refund-policy">refund policy</a> covers what happens if a payment cannot be completed as expected.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="site-footer-section">
                <h2>Legal</h2>
                <p>By using Jacob Estate you agree to our <a href="/terms">terms of service</a>. Our <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a> explains what information we collect and why, the <a href="/cookie-policy">cookie policy</a> explains how cookies are used, and the <a href="/data-protection">data protection page</a> explains your rights over your data. Read the <a href="/advertising-disclosure">advertising disclosure</a> for how sponsored or promoted content is handled.</p>
            </section>
        </div>

        <div class="site-footer-external-block">
            <h2>Useful links elsewhere</h2>
            <p>Rental payments are processed by <a class="site-footer-external" href="https://paystack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Paystack<span class="site-footer-out" aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>. If you want to learn more about your rights as a consumer in Nigeria, see the <a class="site-footer-external" href="https://fccpc.gov.ng" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Federal Competition and Consumer Protection Commission<span class="site-footer-out" aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>, and for your rights over personal data, see the <a class="site-footer-external" href="https://ndpc.gov.ng" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Nigeria Data Protection Commission<span class="site-footer-out" aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>. Jacob Estate is not affiliated with these organisations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="site-footer-bottom">
            <span>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Jacob Estate. All rights reserved.</span>
            <nav aria-label="Legal shortcuts">
                <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
                <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy</a>
                <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookies</a>
                <a href="#top">Back to top</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
